  offerDialogue:
    name: Reed
    sentences:
    - "That\u2019s one of the supply facilities serving Canyon Crossing."
    - 'A lot of the materials that are used around here come through that facility. '
    - The problem is getting them into Canyonville.
    - "The factory isn\u2019t actually far from the city, but the canyon separates
      the two roads. "
    - It makes supplying Canyonville harder than it should be.
    - A direct crossing here would solve that.
    - "But keep in mind, those carts can get pretty heavy when they\u2019re loaded."
    - So don't just think about getting the cart from one side to the other.
    - <b><#E09500>Pay attention to how the bridge responds under that weight</color></b>.
    - <b><#E09500>Watch the structure closely when you run the test</color></b>.
    - 'If you''re interested, I''ve got the contract. '
  continueOfferDialogue:
    name: Reed
    sentences: []
  reminderDialogue:
    name: Reed
    sentences:
    - "The crossing\u2019s yours, {PlayerName}."
    - Keep an eye on how the bridge responds when you run the test.
  finishedContractDialogue:
    name: Reed
    sentences:
    - "That\u2019s exactly what the crossing needed."
    - The factory finally has a direct connection to Canyonville.
    - Getting supplies into the city should be much easier now.
